Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/README.md` first.

This is a greenfield Orion rebuild, not a compatibility refactor. Current code is audit evidence, not architecture authority.

Core rule: model-native tool loop + harness-owned authority + bounded execution + harness-owned evidence.

Never recreate model-visible workflow states such as ACTION_DETAIL/OBSERVATION/FEEDBACK. Never use prose as execution authority. Never add fuzzy capability/target/source resolution or implicit localhost. Never preserve old abstractions merely to reduce diff size.
